# Replace placeholders locally. Never commit passwords, JWTs, or ceremony responses.
@base = https://gateway.example.com/wafish
@origin = https://gateway.example.com
@token = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_JWT
@password = REPLACE_WITH_CURRENT_PASSWORD
@credentialId = REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID
@challengeId = REPLACE_WITH_43_CHARACTER_CHALLENGE_ID

### List authenticators
GET {{base}}/api/webauthn/credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Read one authenticator
GET {{base}}/api/webauthn/credentials/{{credentialId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Begin enrollment; supply twoFactorCode when configured
POST {{base}}/api/webauthn/enrollment/options
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Laptop","password":"{{password}}","twoFactorCode":null}

### Complete enrollment. Replace credential with navigator.credentials.create response data.
# Binary fields must use base64url. Success revokes the JWT above.
POST {{base}}/api/webauthn/enrollment/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId":"{{challengeId}}","credential":{},"twoFactorCode":null}

### Begin login. Retain the returned wafish_webauthn cookie for completion.
POST {{base}}/api/webauthn/login/options
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"operator"}

### Complete login. Replace credential with navigator.credentials.get response data.
# Send the browser cookie returned by login/options. Supply configured TOTP.
POST {{base}}/api/webauthn/login/complete
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"challengeId":"{{challengeId}}","credential":{},"twoFactorCode":null}

### Remove an authenticator. Success revokes existing JWT sessions.
POST {{base}}/api/webauthn/credentials/remove
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Origin: {{origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"credentialId":"{{credentialId}}","password":"{{password}}","twoFactorCode":null}
